From 9423536255d773211dcdff26be10db87752d6f76 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 16:48:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Rebuild the knowledge base on local embeddings and
 embedded Qdrant

The RAG manager no longer sends text to a cloud embedding API or needs a
Qdrant container. Embeddings come from FastEmbed (ONNX Runtime) and Qdrant
runs embedded with its storage in the user state directory; a Qdrant server
is used only when qdrant_url is set (remote servers need https and the
secret qdrant_api_key).

- Model registry: intfloat/multilingual-e5-small (default on CPU, with its
  query/passage prefixes), multilingual-e5-large, BAAI/bge-m3 (GPU tier,
  external weight file). FastEmbed 0.8.1 ships neither e5-small nor bge-m3,
  so both are registered as custom models. rag_embedding_model "auto" keeps
  the model of the existing knowledge base, else picks by hardware and
  reports why.
- One collection per model behind the alias framework_knowledge, so a model
  change never mixes or orphans vectors; an existing collection is checked
  for dimension and vector layout; returned vectors are checked for count,
  dimension and finiteness before anything is stored.
- Hybrid search: named dense vector plus FastEmbed BM25 with Qdrant's IDF
  modifier, fused with RRF; queries under 3 tokens use the dense side only.
  The fixed 0.65 score threshold is gone (similarities are model-specific).
- Structure-aware, token-aware chunking: headings start chunks and give the
  section path, code blocks and tables are never split, long prose breaks at
  sentences with overlap; every chunk is embedded with a
  "Source | Title | Section" preamble.
- Deterministic point ids (uuid5 over source and normalized chunk hash):
  re-ingesting upserts, complete documents drop their stale chunks, equal
  text from several sources is returned once.
- Offline mode never downloads (local_files_only) and says which model is
  missing; Ditto keeps the knowledge base in offline mode.
- Snapshots are portable files (local Qdrant has no snapshot API) and can
  be restored; the embedded storage is released after 30 s idle so the GUI
  and the MCP server can share it.
- Crawler: pages become Markdown (headings, code, tables kept); the
  language filter is configurable (crawler_languages, default en and de).
- Community export uses RAGManager.export_records instead of reaching into
  the Qdrant client; the unused Docker sidecar binds to 127.0.0.1 only.

New dependencies (to be merged centrally): fastembed==0.8.1,
onnxruntime==1.30.0 and their transitive pins.

