From 6a94e2f5759990e3a5967648b6d9221804e75307 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 17:18:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Refuse credentials in qdrant_url already in the config
 schema

The schema now rejects a userinfo part (user:password@) in qdrant_url, so such a
URL is never accepted into or persisted to the plain configuration file; the
runtime check stays for values from older config files.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016nBZCF3akcreLfYwm3cZxU
---
 orchestrator/Core/config_manager.py | 5 +++--
 tests/test_rag.py                   | 6 +++++-
 2 files changed, 8 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

